==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fa|آذربایجان|tr=âzarbâyjân}}, from {{der|en|ar|أَذَرْبَيْجَان}}, from {{der|en|fa-cls|آذربایگان|tr=āðarbāygān}}/{{m|fa-cls|آذربادگان|tr=āzarbādgān}}, from {{der|en|pal|tr=ʾtwrpʾtkʾn}}, {{m|pal|tr=ʾtwrpʾtkn|ts=Ādurbādagān}}, from the name of {{w|Atropates}}, the Persian nobleman who founded the independent kingdom of [[Atropatene]], from {{der|en|peo|*Ātr̥pātah|ts=Āturpat|t=protected by fire}}. For the suffix see {{m|xcl|-ական}}, {{m|fa|گان|tr=gân}}. Compare {{cog|xcl|Ատրպատական}}, {{m|xcl|Ատրապատական}}, {{m|xcl|Ատրպայական}}, {{cog|hy|Ադրբեջան}}, {{cog|gkm|Ἀδαρβιγάνων}}, {{cog|syc|ܐܕܘܪܒܝܓܐܢ|tr=ʾĀḏōrbêḡān}}, {{cog|cop|ⲁⲇⲟⲩⲣⲃⲁⲇⲁⲅⲁⲛ|}}.

